{"observables": 
[{"observable_id": "e-couple-vs-fc-pme3", "unit": "V", "meaning": "The one-electron +1/0 oxidation potential of the PMe3 model complex [Ni(SMe)2(PMe3)2]+/0 in acetonitrile, on the ferrocenium/ferrocene scale, as a best estimate from the registered and newly computed evidence.", "role": "requested", "expected_sign": "negative", "expected_low": -0.75, "expected_high": -0.2, "expectation_basis": "This workspace has already delivered -0.4727 V for the same couple at PBE0-D3BJ/def2-SVP + CPCM(MeCN) from RRHO Gibbs free energies of the validated neutral and doublet-cation minima, and this goal's cycle 1 measured a +0.0786 V def2-SVP to def2-TZVP shift that moves the best estimate to about -0.394 V; a thiolate-rich Ni(II)/Ni(III) pair with two alkyl phosphines sits well below Fc+/Fc.", "required_tolerance": 0.2, "tolerance_basis": "Task words: 'a potential versus ferrocene in acetonitrile good to about plus or minus 0.2 V, which is enough to choose among those three oxidants'."}, {"observable_id": "u-reference-scale-pme3", "unit": "V", "meaning": "The absolute difference between the registered namazian2010 absolute reduction potential of Fc+/Fc in acetonitrile and the same scale reached through the registered Fc-vs-SCE plus SCE-absolute pair, i.e. whether the ferrocene reference scale this couple is quoted against is internally consistent.", "role": "diagnostic", "expected_low": 0.0, "expected_high": 0.02, "expectation_basis": "The registry documents those two entries as one convention family whose stated purpose is to be combined onto the ferrocene scale, so they should reproduce the direct entry to within a few tens of millivolts; the check is aimed at my own delivery, which subtracts this constant from an absolute ionisation free energy and would inherit any inconsistency volt for volt.", "failure_update_rule": "If the gap exceeds 0.02 V, the reference scale stops being a consistency check and is carried as an explicit named component of the couple's uncertainty, quoted beside the value rather than folded silently into the quadrature."}]

}

